CheckoutCtrl --> CheckoutSvc : uses
OrderCtrl --> OrderSvc : uses
WebhookCtrl --> PaymentSvc : uses

CartCtrl ..> [AddToCartRequest] : validates with
CartCtrl ..> [UpdateCartItemRequest] : validates with
CheckoutCtrl ..> [InitiateCheckoutRequest] : validates with
OrderCtrl ..> [PlaceOrderRequest] : validates with
OrderCtrl ..> [CancelOrderRequest] : validates with

CartCtrl ..> [CartResource] : returns
OrderCtrl ..> [OrderResource] : returns
WebhookCtrl ..> [PaymentResource] : returns

' ================================
' SERVICE → SERVICE DEPENDENCIES
' ================================
CartSvc --> ProductModule : validates products
CartSvc --> StockModule : checks stock
CartSvc --> CartModel : manages
CartSvc --> CartItemModel : manages

CheckoutSvc --> CartSvc : uses
