CartItemModel --> DB : persists to
OrderModel --> DB : persists to
OrderItemModel --> DB : persists to
PaymentModel --> DB : persists to
[OrderStatusHistory] --> DB : persists to

' ================================
' EVENT DISPATCHING
' ================================
CartSvc ..> [CartItemAdded] : dispatches
CartSvc ..> [CartItemUpdated] : dispatches
CartSvc ..> [CartMigrated] : dispatches

OrderSvc ..> [OrderCreated] : dispatches
OrderSvc ..> [OrderConfirmed] : dispatches
OrderSvc ..> [OrderShipped] : dispatches
OrderSvc ..> [OrderCancelled] : dispatches

